{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"REM ========================================\nREM BASIC GRAPHICS BENCHMARK v2.0\nREM Measures actual performance in ops/sec\nREM ========================================\nSCREEN 320, 240\nCLSG\n\nPRINT \u0022BASIC BENCHMARK v2.0\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Press SPACE to start...\u0022\nWHILE KEYSTATE(\u0022Space\u0022) = 0\nWEND\nWAIT 200\n\nREM ========================================\nREM TEST 1: PIXEL THROUGHPUT\nREM ========================================\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022TEST 1: Pixel Drawing\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Drawing 10000 pixels...\u0022\n\nframes = 0\nFOR i = 0 TO 9999\n  x = RND(320)\n  y = RND(240)\n  PLOT x, y\n  IF i MOD 100 = 0 THEN\n    WAIT VBL\n    frames = frames \u002B 1\n  ENDIF\nNEXT i\n\npixelsPerFrame = 10000 / frames\nPRINT \u0022Frames used: \u0022, frames\nPRINT \u0022Pixels/frame: \u0022, INT(pixelsPerFrame)\nPRINT \u0022@ 60 FPS = \u0022, INT(pixelsPerFrame * 60), \u0022 pixels/sec\u0022\nWAIT 2000\n\nREM ========================================\nREM TEST 2: LINE DRAWING\nREM ========================================\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022TEST 2: Line Drawing\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Drawing 1000 lines...\u0022\n\nframes = 0\nFOR i = 0 TO 999\n  x1 = RND(320)\n  y1 = RND(240)\n  x2 = RND(320)\n  y2 = RND(240)\n  LINE x1, y1, x2, y2\n  IF i MOD 10 = 0 THEN\n    WAIT VBL\n    frames = frames \u002B 1\n  ENDIF\nNEXT i\n\nlinesPerFrame = 1000 / frames\nPRINT \u0022Frames used: \u0022, frames\nPRINT \u0022Lines/frame: \u0022, INT(linesPerFrame)\nPRINT \u0022@ 60 FPS = \u0022, INT(linesPerFrame * 60), \u0022 lines/sec\u0022\nWAIT 2000\n\nREM ========================================\nREM TEST 3: FILLED RECTANGLES\nREM ========================================\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022TEST 3: Filled Rectangles\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Drawing 500 bars...\u0022\n\nframes = 0\nFOR i = 0 TO 499\n  x1 = RND(280)\n  y1 = RND(200)\n  x2 = x1 \u002B RND(40)\n  y2 = y1 \u002B RND(40)\n  BAR x1, y1, x2, y2\n  IF i MOD 5 = 0 THEN\n    WAIT VBL\n    frames = frames \u002B 1\n  ENDIF\nNEXT i\n\nbarsPerFrame = 500 / frames\nPRINT \u0022Frames used: \u0022, frames\nPRINT \u0022Bars/frame: \u0022, INT(barsPerFrame)\nPRINT \u0022@ 60 FPS = \u0022, INT(barsPerFrame * 60), \u0022 bars/sec\u0022\nWAIT 2000\n\nREM ========================================\nREM TEST 4: CIRCLE DRAWING\nREM ========================================\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022TEST 4: Circle Drawing\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Drawing 500 circles...\u0022\n\nframes = 0\nFOR i = 0 TO 499\n  x = RND(320)\n  y = RND(240)\n  r = RND(30) \u002B 5\n  CIRCLE x, y, r\n  IF i MOD 5 = 0 THEN\n    WAIT VBL\n    frames = frames \u002B 1\n  ENDIF\nNEXT i\n\ncirclesPerFrame = 500 / frames\nPRINT \u0022Frames used: \u0022, frames\nPRINT \u0022Circles/frame: \u0022, INT(circlesPerFrame)\nPRINT \u0022@ 60 FPS = \u0022, INT(circlesPerFrame * 60), \u0022 circles/sec\u0022\nWAIT 2000\n\nREM ========================================\nREM TEST 5: FILLED CIRCLES\nREM ========================================\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022TEST 5: Filled Circles\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Drawing 300 filled circles...\u0022\n\nframes = 0\nFOR i = 0 TO 299\n  x = RND(320)\n  y = RND(240)\n  r = RND(30) \u002B 5\n  CIRCLEF x, y, r, r\n  IF i MOD 5 = 0 THEN\n    WAIT VBL\n    frames = frames \u002B 1\n  ENDIF\nNEXT i\n\ncfPerFrame = 300 / frames\nPRINT \u0022Frames used: \u0022, frames\nPRINT \u0022CirclesF/frame: \u0022, INT(cfPerFrame)\nPRINT \u0022@ 60 FPS = \u0022, INT(cfPerFrame * 60), \u0022 circlef/sec\u0022\nWAIT 2000\n\nREM ========================================\nREM TEST 6: 60 FPS STRESS TEST\nREM ========================================\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022TEST 6: 60 FPS Stress Test\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Drawing max circles @ 60 FPS for 5 sec...\u0022\n\ntotalCircles = 0\nFOR frame = 0 TO 299\n  CLSG\n  \n  REM Draw as many circles as possible per frame\n  FOR i = 0 TO 99\n    x = RND(320)\n    y = RND(240)\n    r = RND(30) \u002B 5\n    CIRCLE x, y, r\n    totalCircles = totalCircles \u002B 1\n  NEXT i\n  \n  WAIT VBL\nNEXT frame\n\navgPerFrame = totalCircles / 300\nPRINT \u0022Total circles: \u0022, totalCircles\nPRINT \u0022Avg/frame: \u0022, INT(avgPerFrame)\nPRINT \u0022Maintained 60 FPS: YES\u0022\nWAIT 2000\n\nREM ========================================\nREM TEST 7: SPRITE PERFORMANCE\nREM ========================================\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022TEST 7: Sprite Movement\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Moving 50 sprites for 5 sec...\u0022\n\nREM Setup sprites\nFOR i = 1 TO 50\n  SPRITE LOAD i, \u0022test_sprite.png\u0022\n  SPRITE POS i, RND(320), RND(240)\n  SPRITE ON i\nNEXT i\n\nframes = 0\nFOR frame = 0 TO 299\n  FOR i = 1 TO 50\n    SPRITE MOVE i, SIN(frame * 0.1), COS(frame * 0.1)\n  NEXT i\n  WAIT VBL\n  frames = frames \u002B 1\nNEXT frame\n\nPRINT \u0022Sprites moved: 50\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Frames: \u0022, frames\nPRINT \u0022Sprite updates: \u0022, 50 * frames\nPRINT \u0022Updates/sec: \u0022, INT((50 * frames) / 5)\nWAIT 2000\n\nREM ========================================\nREM FINAL REPORT\nREM ========================================\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022\nPRINT \u0022    BENCHMARK COMPLETE!\u0022\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u00221. Pixels:    \u0022 \u0026 INT(pixelsPerFrame * 60) \u0026 \u0022/sec\u0022\nPRINT \u00222. Lines:     \u0022 \u0026 INT(linesPerFrame * 60) \u0026 \u0022/sec\u0022\nPRINT \u00223. Bars:      \u0022 \u0026 INT(barsPerFrame * 60) \u0026 \u0022/sec\u0022\nPRINT \u00224. Circles:   \u0022 \u0026 INT(circlesPerFrame * 60) \u0026 \u0022/sec\u0022\nPRINT \u00225. CirclesF:  \u0022 \u0026 INT(cfPerFrame * 60) \u0026 \u0022/sec\u0022\nPRINT \u00226. Stress:    \u0022 \u0026 INT(avgPerFrame) \u0026 \u0022 circles/frame\u0022\nPRINT \u00227. Sprites:   \u0022 \u0026 INT((50 * frames) / 5) \u0026 \u0022 updates/sec\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022\nPRINT \u0022System: AmosLikeBasic v1.0\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Date: 2026-03-09\u0022\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022\n\nREM Save results\nOPEN OUT 1,\u0022benchmark.txt\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022BASIC BENCHMARK RESULTS\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022=======================\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022Pixels/sec:    \u0022 \u0026 INT(pixelsPerFrame * 60)\nPRINT #1, \u0022Lines/sec:     \u0022 \u0026 INT(linesPerFrame * 60)\nPRINT #1, \u0022Bars/sec:      \u0022 \u0026 INT(barsPerFrame * 60)\nPRINT #1, \u0022Circles/sec:   \u0022 \u0026 INT(circlesPerFrame * 60)\nPRINT #1, \u0022CirclesF/sec:  \u0022 \u0026 INT(cfPerFrame * 60)\nPRINT #1, \u0022Circles/frame: \u0022 \u0026 INT(avgPerFrame)\nPRINT #1, \u0022Sprite upd/s:  \u0022 \u0026 INT((50 * frames) / 5)\nCLOSE 1\n\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Results saved to benchmark.txt\u0022"}